Carafe loader is based on nx-hbloader (https://github.com/switchbrew/nx-hbloader,
commit 82b95122c5ae8dc059bf23893ba7623c72c86773). trampoline.s is used unmodified from
third_party/nx-hbloader; source/main.c follows the structure of nx-hbloader's main.c.

